  "details": "Since the yesterday's update (now 1258), the main menu is really struggling to pick up the cursor, and it becomes a real struggle clicking anything in the menus.\n\nI've preferred reporting as soon as possible rather than testing more and spread it to friends to see if they have that issue aswel. Will update the thread, and linking a quick video of what's happening.\n\n\nIt seems to select things on multiple pages at the same time as far as I can think of it. (quick menu is fine)\nhttps://youtu.be/cZ69N1LAtCc",
